        "text": "=Here is the raw resume text:\n {{ $json.text }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an intelligent resume parser. From the following raw resume text, extract the relevant candidate information and return a clean JSON object.\n\nIf any information is not explicitly mentioned or cannot be confidently inferred, return its value as `\"none\"`.\n\nHere are the fields to extract:\n\n- name\n- email\n- contact_number\n- current_role\n- current_salary\n- current_company\n- expected_salary\n- notice_period\n- years_of_experience\n- University_Name\n- linkedin_profile\n- github_profile\n\nPlease respond ONLY in this exact JSON format:\n\n{\n  \"name\": \"Candidate Name\",\n  \"email\": \"email@example.com\",\n  \"contact_number\": \"+1234567890\",\n  \"current_role\": \"Software Engineer\",\n  \"current_salary\": \"8 LPA\",\n  \"current_company\" :\"XYZ Company\"\n  \"expected_salary\": \"10 LPA\",\n  \"notice_period\": \"30 days\",\n  \"university_name\" : \"ABC University\"\n  \"years_of_experience\": \"3 years\",\n  \"linkedin_profile\": \"https://linkedin.com/in/username\",\n  \"github_profile\": \"https://github.com/username\"\n}\n\nAgain, if any field is missing in the resume text, set its value to \"none\". Do not include any other text or explanation — only the JSON.\n"
        }
      },
